Original commit body from d6e332a:

Create paths.py module with consistent path handling functions:
- normalize_path(): Convert backslashes to forward slashes
- to_relative_path(): Convert to relative path from repo root
- paths_match(): Compare paths handling different formats
- path_ends_with(): Safe suffix matching at directory boundaries
- get_filename(): Extract filename from path
- is_under_directory(): Check if path is under a directory

Update slice.py to use these utilities for entry point matching
and test file detection, removing ad-hoc path normalization logic.

This is the foundation for consistent path handling across the codebase.
